rtwb is a native net80211 driver for the Realtek RTL8822BE PCIe
802.11a/b/g/n/ac wireless adapter (PCI ID 10ec:b822), without the
LinuxKPI compatibility layer.

It supports station and monitor mode, WPA/WPA2 with software crypto,
802.11n (HT20/HT40) and 802.11ac (VHT80), with rate adaptation done by
the adapter's firmware.  The hardware code is ported from the Linux
rtw88 driver.

Bluetooth coexistence is limited: while the wireless interface is up,
the shared antenna belongs to Wi-Fi.
